10 CLS
12 MEMORY &67FF
13 GOSUB 10000
15 debug=0:compute=0
25 INK 0,0:INK 1,26:INK 3,15
30 BORDER 2
320 txt%=&6800
400 MODE 1:GOSUB 7000
